# FazalDataConverter — Cursor Project Rules

Read and follow `RULES.md` in this repository root for complete project rules.

## Source of Truth
- `PRD.md` for product requirements.
- `TRD.md` for technical specs.
- `RULES.md` for universal dev rules.

## Critical Rules
- Font: Inter only.
- Colors: PRD Section 10.5 and TRD Section 5 design tokens only.
- Security: No macro/script execution. 50 MB limit. Zod validation. Server-side ownership checks.
- Code: 2-space indent. PascalCase components. ESLint + Prettier.
- Language: English only in all code and docs.
- Never invent features outside PRD.md or TRD.md.
